### 1. Get all products
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products


### 2. Create a product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "iphone",
  "price": 55000,
  "category": "Electronics"
}


### 3. Create another product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Wireless Mouse",
  "price": 1200,
  "category": "Accessories"
}


